{
  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 6,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.104,
            0.184,
            0.121
          ],
          "content": "STATISTICS"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.863,
            0.104,
            0.898,
            0.12
          ],
          "content": "177"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.159,
            0.195,
            0.177
          ],
          "content": "We have,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.44,
            0.149,
            0.562,
            0.187
          ],
          "content": "u _ { _ i } = \\; \\frac { x _ { _ i } - a } { h }",
          "image_source": "images/page_6_equation_3.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.233,
            0.205,
            0.252
          ],
          "content": "Therefore,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.434,
            0.205,
            0.805,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": "\\begin{aligned}\\overline{\\overline{u}} &= \\frac{\\Sigma f_{i} \\frac{\\left( x_{i} - a \\right)}{h}}{\\Sigma f_{i}} = \\frac{1}{h} \\left[ \\frac{\\Sigma f_{i} x_{i} - a \\Sigma f_{i}}{\\Sigma f_{i}} \\right] \\\\&= \\frac{1}{h} \\left[ \\frac{\\Sigma f_{i} x_{i}}{\\Sigma f_{i}} - a \\frac{\\Sigma f_{i}}{\\Sigma f_{i}} \\right] \\\\&= \\frac{1}{h} \\big[ \\overline{x} - a \\big]\\end{aligned}",
          "image_source": "images/page_6_equation_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.395,
            0.135,
            0.413
          ],
          "content": "So,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.424,
            0.391,
            0.554,
            0.412
          ],
          "content": "\\left[ h \\overline { { u } } \\right. = \\left. \\overline { { x } } - a \\right.",
          "image_source": "images/page_6_equation_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.424,
            0.139,
            0.442
          ],
          "content": "i.e.,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.439,
            0.422,
            0.567,
            0.442
          ],
          "content": "\\overline{x} = a + \\overline{h} \\overline{u}",
          "image_source": "images/page_6_equation_9.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.475,
            0.134,
            0.493
          ],
          "content": "So,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.438,
            0.457,
            0.626,
            0.506
          ],
          "content": "\\bar{x} \\leq a + h \\left( \\frac{\\Sigma f_i u_i}{\\Sigma f_i} \\right)",
          "image_source": "images/page_6_equation_11.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.512,
            0.816,
            0.532
          ],
          "content": "Now, substituting the values of $a , h , \\Sigma f _ { i } u _ { i }$ and $\\Sigma f_{i}$ from Table 14.5, we get"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.436,
            0.545,
            0.664,
            0.589
          ],
          "content": "\\overline{x} = 47.5 + 15 \\times \\left( \\frac{29}{30} \\right)",
          "image_source": "images/page_6_equation_13.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.462,
            0.598,
            0.652,
            0.618
          ],
          "content": "47.5 + 14.5 = 62",
          "image_source": "images/page_6_equation_14.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.625,
            0.556,
            0.644
          ],
          "content": "So, the mean marks obtained by a student is 62"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.65,
            0.738,
            0.669
          ],
          "content": "The method discussed above is called the Step-deviation method."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.676,
            0.291,
            0.694
          ],
          "content": "We note that :"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.701,
            0.902,
            0.738
          ],
          "content": "• the step-deviation method will be convenient to apply if all the $d _ { i } ^ { \\; \\prime } \\: \\mathrm { s }$ have a common factor."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.745,
            0.724,
            0.764
          ],
          "content": "• The mean obtained by all the three methods is the same."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.77,
            0.9,
            0.808
          ],
          "content": "• The assumed mean method and step-deviation method are just simplified forms of the direct method."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.813,
            0.9,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": "• The formula $\\overline{x} = a + h\\overline{u}$ still holds if a and h are not as given above, but are any non-zero numbers such that $u _ { _ i } = \\frac { x _ { _ i } - a } { h }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.879,
            0.607,
            0.899
          ],
          "content": "Let us apply these methods in another example."
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.967,
            0.563,
            0.983
          ],
          "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
